{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in a mysterious place, <strong>Aquariums</strong> and <strong>Liminal Halls</strong> surround you... As you go deeper your mind starts to play tricks, did you see something move inside the tank? Or is it just your <strong>Thalassophobia</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/652461163505cc678985fea1ef70ec19.poster.avif?t=1767125398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/652461163505cc678985fea1ef70ec19.webm?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/652461163505cc678985fea1ef70ec19.mp4?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you wander <strong>Aquariums</strong>, the more inevitable it becomes \u2014 you\u2019ll have to step into the water and face what waits inside the tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/105d964caa6a2d6dee760b64da123f1f.poster.avif?t=1767125398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/105d964caa6a2d6dee760b64da123f1f.webm?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/105d964caa6a2d6dee760b64da123f1f.mp4?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in a vast <strong>liminal facility</strong> of strange Aquariums, swimming pools and corridors, you must uncover the truth behind its creation... You will encounter entities like the <strong>Divers</strong>\u00a0who seem to be in some kind of trance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/2293ccfe1987bb38ca38f48751fff399.poster.avif?t=1767125398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/2293ccfe1987bb38ca38f48751fff399.webm?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/2293ccfe1987bb38ca38f48751fff399.mp4?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find sharks, lost divers, gigantic whales and a sense of a horrible past... The creatures you encounter will haunt you and twist your perception of what\u2019s real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/1aa6b68eecdd81a9fa7078b536cf8c19.poster.avif?t=1767125398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/1aa6b68eecdd81a9fa7078b536cf8c19.webm?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/1aa6b68eecdd81a9fa7078b536cf8c19.mp4?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AQUARIUMS</strong> has seven unique chapters, each taking 10 to 30 minutes to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>AQUARIUMS</i> draws inspiration from internet phenomena like <strong>liminal spaces, found footage, thalassophobia</strong>, the <strong>Poolrooms</strong>, and the <strong>Backrooms</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo developer driven by a love for horror games \u2014 and a lifelong fear of sharks and deep water.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Diving In","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654850/7dd3a2b2a71d35ce2d152fcf57a204e0134d1478.jpg"},{"name":"Mystery Door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654850/2fe1cd396f47a923c52f9b92bf133b7d49bbc3e6.jpg"},{"name":"Thalassophobia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654850/295153ce5fc1983888d4856302e5f69d12879395.jpg"},{"name":"Tape 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654850/684e276765f6584a4aee7abd3e331acd0562c622.jpg"},{"name":"Forgotten Memories ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654850/1fe2cf4e8ae8444732fee1dbba0767c8f181149f.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Deep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654850/c245d0e1892f343bfd33eb1e291fb36972746099.jpg"},{"name":"Gone Swimming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654850/41af3769006820ace9fe268d10085ee9d9ea2f24.jpg"},{"name":"Secrets...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654850/57546d42f02ad1f73fce0855a43ed0d1430a1245.jpg"},{"name":"Insanity Continues","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654850/c67c2b9a8fa401f984a644d50f927c3000758bcf.jpg"},{"name":"That just happened...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3654850/d21066d554c9fdad0d95dfeeb9b6136c54647fbf.jpg"}],"total":